{
  "id": "JOB.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 31",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I made a covenant with mine eyes; why then should I think upon a maid?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For what portion of God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from above? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "what",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inheritance of the Almighty from on high?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not destruction to the wicked? and a strange",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "punishment",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the workers of iniquity?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doth not he see my ways, and count all my steps?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have walked with vanity, or if my foot hath hasted to deceit;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me be weighed in an even balance, that God may know mine integrity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If my step hath turned out of the way, and mine heart walked after mine eyes, and if any blot hath cleaved to mine hands;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let me sow, and let another eat; yea, let my offspring be rooted out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If mine heart have been deceived by a woman, or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have laid wait at my neighbour's door;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let my wife grind unto another, and let others bow down upon her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an heinous crime; yea, it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an iniquity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to be punished by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judges.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "consumeth to destruction, and would root out all mine increase.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I did despise the cause of my manservant or of my maidservant, when they contended with me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What then shall I do when God riseth up? and when he visiteth, what shall I answer him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Did not he that made me in the womb make him? and did not one fashion us in the womb?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have withheld the poor from",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "desire, or have caused the eyes of the widow to fail;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or have eaten my morsel myself alone, and the fatherless hath not eaten thereof;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(For from my youth he was brought up with me, as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a father, and I have guided her from my mother's womb;)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have seen any perish for want of clothing, or any poor without covering;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If his loins have not blessed me, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he were",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "not",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "warmed with the fleece of my sheep;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have lifted up my hand against the fatherless, when I saw my help in the gate:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let mine arm fall from my shoulder blade, and mine arm be broken from the bone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For destruction",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "from",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a terror to me, and by reason of his highness I could not endure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have made gold my hope, or have said to the fine gold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Thou art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my confidence;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I rejoiced because my wealth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great, and because mine hand had gotten much;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I beheld the sun when it shined, or the moon walking",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brightness;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my heart hath been secretly enticed, or my mouth hath kissed my hand:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an iniquity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to be punished by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the judge: for I should have denied the God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "above.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I rejoiced at the destruction of him that hated me, or lifted up myself when evil found him:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neither have I suffered my mouth to sin by wishing a curse to his soul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the men of my tabernacle said not, Oh that we had of his flesh! we cannot be satisfied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The stranger did not lodge in the street:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I opened my doors to the traveller.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I covered my transgressions as Adam, by hiding mine iniquity in my bosom:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Did I fear a great multitude, or did the contempt of families terrify me, that I kept silence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "went not out of the door?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh that one would hear me! behold, my desire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is, that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the Almighty would answer me, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine adversary had written a book.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely I would take it upon my shoulder,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bind it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.31.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.31.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a crown to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I would declare unto him the number of my steps; as a prince would I go near unto him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If my land cry against me, or that the furrows likewise thereof complain;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I have eaten the fruits thereof without money, or have caused the owners thereof to lose their life:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let thistles grow instead of wheat, and cockle instead of barley. The words of Job are ended.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.31.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
